---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"looks\", \"default\"])"
---
Set the look new photos get

Usage: ym looks default [OPTIONS] <LOOK>

Arguments:
  <LOOK>  The look: its full id, the part after the colon, or its name

Options:
  -q, --quiet    Print only errors on stderr
  -v, --verbose  Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
  -h, --help     Print help
